I was unable to reproduce this issue.

In the composer, I created the following circuit:
```
OPENQASM 2.0;
include "qelib1.inc";

qreg q[2];
creg c[4];
h q[0];
cx q[0], q[1];
barrier q;
cx q[0], q[1];
barrier q[0], q[1];
cx q[0], q[1];
barrier q[0], q[1];
cx q[0], q[1];
barrier q;
cx q[0], q[1];
barrier q[0], q[1];
cx q[0], q[1];
barrier q[0], q[1];
cx q[0], q[1];
measure q[0] -> c[0];
measure q[1] -> c[1];
```

Then I execute it in `ibm_torino`. The job page says that the following circuit is running:
```
